title: Investigating Domestic Enemies
on-arrival: month_actions += 1
view-if: spd_in_government = 1 and interior_minister_party = "LWUSP"
#card-image: img/portraits/greiser.jpg
#is-card: true
#new-page: true

# this is not a card...

= Investigating Domestic Enemies

As we have control over the Interior Ministry, we can direct police and intelligence services to investigate internal enemies. We can proscribe various organizations.

- @ban_ys: Ban the <span style="color: #000000;">**Young Sords**</span>.
- @unban_ys: Unban the <span style="color: #000000;">**Young Sords**</span>.
- @persecute_ys
- @ban_bff: Ban the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Bludish Freedom Front**</span>.
- @unban_bff: Unban the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Bludish Freedom Front**</span>.
- @persecute_bff
- @ban_ry: Ban the <span style="color: #c00000;">Communist</span> <span style="color: #c00000;">**Red Youth**</span>.
- @unban_ry: Unban the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Red Youth**</span>.
- @persecute_ry
- @root: Take no action for now.

@ban_ys
view-if: ys_banned == 0
on-arrival: ys_strength *= 0.85; ys_strength *= 0.7 if interior_police_loyalty >= 0.7; ys_banned_pro = 1 if interior_police_loyalty >= 0.7; ys_banned_pro = 0 if interior_police_loyalty < 0.7; ys_banned = 1; rwusp_relation -= 3; cwusp_relation -= 3; nfp_relation -= 5; interior_police_loyalty -= 0.05; ys_militancy -= 0.05; ys_ban_timer = 6; ys_coup_progress -= 2 if ys_coup_progress >= 6; nationalism -= 1

As it turns out, the <span style="color: #000000;">ultranationalist</span> <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Young Sords**</span> have many allies in the police and bureaucracy. Our relationship with the police weakens, and the <span style="color: #000000;">**Young Sords**</span> can still organize illegally, right under the police's noses. [? if ys_banned_pro : Nevertheless, the <span style="color: #000000;">**Young Sords**</span> are substantially weakened by our ban. ?]

[? if ys_coup_progress >= 6: There are reports of an imminent coup by the <span style="color: #000000;">**NFP**</span>. We have disrupted some of these plans, but the threat is still present. ?]

@unban_ys
view-if: ys_banned = 1
on-arrival: ys_banned = 0; ys_strength += 100; ys_militancy += 0.05; ys_coup_progress += 2 if ys_coup_progress >= 6; cps_relation -= 3; wpb_relation -= 3; pfjp_relation -= 3; workers_nfp += 2; new_middle_nfp += 2; old_middle_nfp += 2; unemployed_nfp += 1; rural_nfp += 1; nationalism += 2; pro_republic -= 1

The <span style="color: #000000;">**Young Sords**</span> are no longer banned. They immediately go on a recruiting spree.

@persecute_ys
title: Further persecute the <span style="color: #000000;">**Young Sords**</span>.
view-if: ys_banned = 1
choose-if: judicial_reform >= 3 and interior_police_loyalty >= 0.7
unavailable-subtitle: [? if judicial_reform < 3 : The judiciary would not allow this. ?] [? if interior_police_loyalty < 0.7 : The police are too disloyal to be trusted with this. ?]
on-arrival: ys_strength *= 0.7; ys_militancy -= 0.05; ys_coup_progress -= 2 if ys_coup_progress >= 4

We have arrested more of the <span style="color: #000000;">**Young Sords**</span>'s leaders and confiscated their weapons.

[? if coup_progress >= 4: There are reports of a planned coup by the <span style="color: #000000;">**NFP**</span>. We have cracked down on some of these plans, but the threat still lingers. ?]

@ban_bff
view-if: in_left_coalition = 0 and bff_banned = 0
on-arrival: wpb_relation -= 15; bff_strength -= 50; bff_banned = 1; cps_relation -= 3; rwusp_relation += 5; nfp_relation += 5; cwusp_relation += 5; interior_police_loyalty += 0.1; coalition_dissent -= 0.5 if coalition_dissent > 0 and in_usp_coalition; bluds_lwusp -= 5; rural_lwusp += 3*(1-dissent)

The ban is enthusiastically carried out by the police, perhaps too enthusiastically. The Left and the Bluds dislike this move.

@unban_bff
view-if: bff_banned = 1
on-arrival: bff_banned = 0; wpb_relation += 5; bff_strength += 50; interior_police_loyalty -= 0.05; army_loyalty -= 0.05; rwusp_relation -= 5; bluds_lwusp += 2; rural_lwusp -= 3; rural_cwusp -= 1; rural_nfp += 4; coalition_dissent += 1 if in_usp_coalition

The separatist <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**BFF**</span> is no longer banned.

@persecute_bff
title: Further persecute the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Bludish Freedom Front**</span>.
view-if: bff_banned = 1 and in_left_coalition = 0
on-arrival: bff_strength *= 0.7; bff_militancy -= 0.05; wpb_relation -= 10; cwusp_relation += 2; rwusp_relation += 2; nfp_relation += 2; army_loyalty += 0.1; interior_police_loyalty += 0.1; coalition_dissent -= 0.5 if coalition_dissent > 0 and in_usp_coalition; bluds_lwusp -= 2

We have arrested more of the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**BFF**</span>'s leaders and confiscated their weapons.

@ban_ry
view-if: ry_banned and in_left_coalition = 0
on-arrival: cps_relation -= 15; ry_strength -= 50; ry_banned = 1; rwusp_relation += 5; nfp_relation += 5; cwusp_relation += 5; army_loyalty += 0.1; interior_police_loyalty += 0.1; coalition_dissent -= 0.5 if coalition_dissent > 0 and in_usp_coalition; workers_lwusp -= 1; unemployed_lwusp -= 1; socialism -= 1

The ban is enthusiastically carried out by the police, perhaps too enthusiastically. The <span style="color: #c00000;">**CPS**</span> takes this as one more reason why the <span style="color: #6e377a;">**USP**</span> cannot be trusted. The right approves.

@unban_ry
view-if: ry_banned = 1
on-arrival: ry_banned = 0; cps_relation += 5; ry_strength += 50; army_loyalty -= 0.05; interior_police_loyalty -= 0.05; workers_cps += 1; unemployed_cps += 1; socialism += 1

The <span style="color: #c00000;">**Red Youth**</span> is no longer banned.

@persecute_ry
title: Further persecute the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Red Youth**</span>.
view-if: ry_banned = 1 and in_left_coalition = 0
on-arrival: ry_strength *= 0.7; ry_militancy -= 0.05; cps_relation -= 10; cwusp_relation += 2; rwusp_relation += 2; nfp_relation += 2; army_loyalty += 0.1; interior_police_loyalty += 0.1; coalition_dissent -= 1 if in_usp_coalition; workers_lwusp -= 1; old_middle_nfp -= 1; new_middle_nfp -= 1; rural_nfp -= 2; old_middle_rwusp += 1; new_middle_rwusp += 1; rural_rwusp += 2

We have arrested more of the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Red Youth**</span>'s leaders and confiscated their weapons.

@root
